Kenneth,

Thank you for this morning's decision. Attached is the agreement signed today=
 by you and Elizabeth, WCL-JP-FIN-AGR-2026-001 v1.0.

As agreed, please arrange for Japan Finance to provide the five departments' =
primary and deputy contacts, confirmation of both people's step 07 authority =
and evidence receipt, and the authorised weekly CSV by Friday 24 July. We wil=
l start on 27 July. Where a department's prerequisites are not confirmed, its=
 existing route remains in place.

The signed baseline is Finance only, for twelve weeks and a fixed fee of JPY =
42.8m excluding tax. Any work beyond it needs a clause 4 change describing sc=
ope and fee and schedule effects, approved in writing by authorised represent=
atives of both companies before that work starts.

Best,
Nicholas

Nicholas Hargreaves
Holt & Reeves Advisory Ltd


